c['status']); ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; if(!$conns): ?><tr><td colspan="5" class="muted">Belum ada koneksi aktif.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></table></div></div></div></div><script defer src="<?php echo e(asset_url('assets/app.js')); ?>"></script></body></html>
